Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.36,0:04:59.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是按照 B-22 剧本发表的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.41,0:04:57.56,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(030,050)}外星人的袭击吗…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.66,0:05:02.66,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(030,050)}是，不用担心爆炸中心的污染
