Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.76,0:05:12.46,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(030,050)}是的，和模型模拟一样，其中 99.9% 以上蒸发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.66,0:05:11.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是吗，其实现在大家都很害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:12.81,0:05:13.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这是当然的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.66,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总之，一切正如你所说的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过，碇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:19.26,0:05:22.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}NERV 和 EVA 你们难道不能用得更好些吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.76,0:05:28.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}零号机和第一次上阵就弄坏的初号机的修理费
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:28.46,0:05:30.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可是会弄垮一个国家的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.16,0:05:34.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}听说你把那个玩具给你儿子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.66,0:05:37.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人力、时间、还有金钱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.26,0:05:41.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你们父子究竟要花多少才甘心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.26,0:05:44.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}而且你的工作不只是这个而已吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.46,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这才是你当前的要务
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.86,0:05:51.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错，这个计划才是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.10,0:05:56.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们在这绝境下唯一的希望
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}总而言之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.16,0:06:02.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}即使是使徒再访也不允许计划的时间表有任何延误
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.96,0:06:05.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}预算我们会给予考虑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.96,0:06:08.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那再来就是委员会的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.71,0:06:10.86,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇，辛苦你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.76,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碇，已经无法再回头了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.66,0:06:21.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.16,0:06:24.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}人类已经没有时间了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.86,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}空调果然是人类的至宝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还真是科学的胜利呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.36,0:06:58.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真嗣似乎已经清醒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.76,0:07:00.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那他的情况怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.96,0:07:04.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没有外伤，但记忆好像有些混乱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.96,0:07:06.86,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难道是精神污染
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.46,0:07:08.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好像没有这种顾虑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.66,0:07:10.76,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也对，突然发生这种事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.26,0:07:19.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这也难怪，因为他的脑神经承受了相当的负担
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.36,0:07:21.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}应该说是“心理”吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.56,0:07:40.36,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(200,150)\fs49.5}第 25 制导武器系统大楼（甲 - H 型）建筑计划通知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.76,0:07:52.71,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}EVA 和这个城市如果可以完全运作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.71,0:07:53.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}说不定能行的通呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你认为能赢使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.76,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是老样子，真是乐观
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}充满希望的预测可是人类生存的必需品哦
