Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.76,0:09:12.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这样行吗，真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没问题，一个人更好
