Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.66,0:10:00.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没想到这里真的会变成战场
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:00.96,0:10:02.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:02.56,0:10:06.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我老公也说只有我和孩子也好，叫我们先疏散
