Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.26,0:11:30.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第 3 新东京市（TOKYO - 3）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.26,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我们的城市哦
