Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.36,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是你所保护的城市
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.76,0:11:55.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我想你的行李应该都已经送到了
