Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.96,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}像这样和其他人一起吃饭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.96,0:13:46.56,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}是
