Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.34,0:13:56.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}布
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}布
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.34,0:13:58.06,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}布
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.56,0:14:01.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不好意思了，真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.86,0:14:06.16,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好，公平决定的家务轮值这样就都 OK 了
