Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:54.24,0:13:55.06,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ポン
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.34,0:13:56.06,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ポン！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.34,0:13:57.06,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ポン！
